ds_list_add(textList, "According to legend, this mallet was used by a famous Italian Plumber.", "Yes, while other so-called 'heroes' stuck to their painfully safe swords and shields and green tunics,", "The Mustachioed Man journeyed across a country said to be suffering from a terrible fungus infection, to save it.", "They say that was his first RPG adventure. ", "You know, Real Plunger Dynamics, that is. Since he's a plumber.")